abstract: >-
  Vietnamese AI Framework (v31.2.0) provides ViLegal-TemporalRAG, the open
  ViLegal-TempBench benchmark (160 clauses, 68 QA), ViEdge-RustEngine,
  ViAlign-SafeLoop, and a bundled 38,372-word Vietnamese lexicon for
  reproducible CPU-only Vietnamese AI and deterministic three-tier legal
  citation verification with optional real LLM integration.
